==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 4.67~6.67 seconds<sup>140f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**6 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**6 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]], [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] to stop the enemies attacking your base.

